Author: Sofiane Bebert <sofiane@bebert.co>
Date:   Sun Nov 8 13:51:56 2026 +0000

    feat(ui): Cached Trash is a read-only list context, not a drawer

    Trash reuses the InboxList rows and the Done/Starred context machinery
    (paging, history, Back to the exact row). A readOnly list mode hides row
    actions and selection; every mailbox action stays unavailable in the list
    and reader. One Ash coverage line carries the caveat, full text in a title.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Entire-Checkpoint: 01M6XPW60SK5T5WK1G3ESECMR2

